{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01312","headline":"相和歌辞 长门怨 · 齐澣","name":"相和歌辞 长门怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茕茕孤思逼，寂寂长门夕。\n妾妬亦非深，君恩那不惜。\n携琴就玉阶，调悲声未谐。\n将心托明月，流影入君怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐澣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}